---
const facts = [
    { term: 'Founded', value: '2009' },
    { term: 'Projects completed', value: '10+' },
    { term: 'Working in', value: 'Colorado and Utah' },
];

const principles = [
    { title: 'Mountain-inspired', text: 'Spaces that answer to the light, materials, and weather of the Rockies.' },
    { title: 'Sustainable', text: 'Eco-conscious materials and energy-efficient systems, specified from the start.' },
    { title: 'Award-winning', text: 'Craftsmanship and attention to detail that hold up long after the reveal.' },
];
---

<section id="studio" class="studio">
    <div class="container studio-grid">
        <div class="studio-text">
            <span class="kicker">The studio</span>
            <h2>Named for a rule you learned in grade school.</h2>
            <p class="studio-lede">The associative property says that <span class="math">(a + b) + c</span> equals <span class="math">a + (b + c)</span>. Change the grouping and the answer stays put.</p>
            <p>We run projects the same way. Since 2009 we have brought designers, architects, contractors, and owners into one working group across Colorado and Utah. Whoever leads a phase, and whatever order the work arrives in, the finished space comes out the way it was drawn.</p>
            <p>We work with homeowners, commercial developers, and hospitality brands, from a single room to a full build.</p>

            <ul class="principles">
                {principles.map((p) => (
                    <li>
                        <h3>{p.title}</h3>
                        <p>{p.text}</p>
                    </li>
                ))}
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="studio-aside">
            <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?w=900&h=1100&fit=crop&q=80"
                alt="A light-filled modern living room with timber and stone finishes"
                width="900"
                height="1100"
                loading="lazy"
                class="studio-img"
            >
            <dl class="facts">
                {facts.map((f) => (
                    <div>
                        <dt>{f.term}</dt>
                        <dd>{f.value}</dd>
                    </div>
                ))}
            </dl>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
.studio {
    padding: var(--section-y) 0;
}

.studio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    align-items: start;
}

.studio-text h2 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.studio-text > p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: #3B4448;
}

.studio-lede {
    font-size: 1.4375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--granite) !important;
}

.math {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 450;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--rose);
}

.principles {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
}

.principles h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.principles p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--mist);
}

.studio-aside {
    position: sticky;
    top: 110px;
}

.studio-img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 11;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px 2px 120px 2px;
}

.facts {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
}

.facts div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.facts dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--mist);
}

.facts dd {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: right;
}

@media (max-width: 960px) {
    .studio-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .studio-aside {
        position: static;
        max-width: 560px;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .principles {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }
}
</style>
